{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_01_beg","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_01","title":"特里蒙街道","storyCode":"DV-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3909026ca5bdd62c385762d7882d04d261e87552cb44757e7cdd79e0535bb6ff","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士與Mechanist前往小巷調查繆爾賽思失蹤一事，遇到伏擊；城外，拓荒者想以人質為籌碼得到自由，卻遭到拒絕。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"3:56 P.M. 天氣/陰\n特里蒙主城區"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你第三遍瀏覽白面鴞的個人記錄了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有什麼新發現？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"白面鴞的記錄有著豐富的細節。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白面鴞的腦部植入了某種特殊晶片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“九號裝置”——梅爾這麼稱呼它。這應該是萊茵生命對這項技術的內部代號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它直接連接著白面鴞的腦部神經，作為大腦的一部分正常運作著，同時也記錄著她各個腦區神經活動的資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，你剛才看到的，就是白面鴞的視覺處理器——她的雙眼記錄的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"拓荒隊領隊受過良好教育。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞拓荒隊的成員什麼出身都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對當前生活不滿的年輕人，欠了債日子過不下去的中年夫婦，小偷小摸被抓住了又不想蹲大牢的罪犯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，還有無力支付高額保險費用，又不甘心被關在收治區的感染者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"埃琳娜的咖啡應該挺香的。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是對弗蘭克斯使用的提神試劑更感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下班之後的酒精是很美妙，但工作時喝那麼多液體，也未免太容易打斷思路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從白面鴞同步給我們的記錄來看，除她之外，同為羅德島合作幹員、就職於萊茵生命能量科的埃琳娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連同萊茵生命源石技藝應用科主任多蘿西·弗蘭克斯，一起遭到了拓荒者的綁架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而幾乎與此同時，塞雷婭告訴我們，萊茵生命生態科主任繆爾賽思在發出緊急求援資訊之後就失蹤了，目前生死未卜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"萊茵生命是不是出事了？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前來看，是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"難道做研究也是高危工作？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到哥倫比亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓塞雷婭向羅德島求助，萊茵生命目前很大機率已經陷入危機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸虧本艦就在附近，否則我們也很難迅速作出反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然綁架事件發生在距離特里蒙城一百多公里的新基地，但凱爾希擔心此事與先前被叫停的那些實驗有關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那個基地是做什麼的？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對外資料顯示，那是一個正在建設中的普通實驗場所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"源石變異實驗......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在進入特里蒙之前，凱爾希向我們開放了所有相關檔案的權限。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"再介紹下特里蒙吧。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市是哥倫比亞的科學與技術中心。數百家科技公司將總部設在特里蒙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“炎魔事件”“洛肯水箱”“伐木場”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上述每一個名詞都對應了一位我們羅德島的幹員，背後更是牽涉了數百個類似的實驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些實驗大多涉及源石對生物細胞的變異作用，每一項都非常危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哥倫比亞，大型科技公司比如萊茵生命往往並不直接參與類似具有高風險的實驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會將實驗委託給規模較小的機構，雇傭拓荒隊，在城市邊緣的荒地上建立相應的基地來完成實驗工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此次事件中，白面鴞所在的359號基地就是其中一處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我記得你過去的工作經歷......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你是不是也在類似基地工作過？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作？我並不想把那段經歷稱作“工作”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些大企業“剽竊”了我的創作，把它們應用到了不該應用的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到五十米外的看板了嗎？“沃爾沃特科欽斯基基家用自動爆米花機，更快更甜更穩定。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的能源核心原型草圖還留在我的終端上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最初它該用在荒地路面自動清理機內部，可是我的主管斷定這款產品一定賣不出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說，哪家人力資源公司會願意為拓荒者購買更好的裝備？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來我帶著思路來到了羅德島，我們的航線排障工程隊正在使用的就是最新型號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就知道，無論是沃爾沃特科欽斯基，還是萊茵生命，這些所謂的科技公司，它們最終會被自己的造物摧毀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為它們從未尊重過創造本身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"繆爾賽思難道正被自己的實驗品追殺？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"白面鴞不會被恐怖實驗體綁架了吧？！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該笑一下嗎，博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，你說的可能不是什麼科幻故事，或者一個荒誕笑話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它很可能是明天的新聞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"難怪可露希爾對你又佩服又害怕......","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指，她偶爾會兼任我的新武器測試用靶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要別拿靠不住的點子打擾我工作，她就沒必要感到害怕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"你和Logos不愧是好搭檔。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為搭檔，Logos是還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過博士，你能提醒一下他嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他能省略一些修辭，任務耗時將縮短至少三十個百分點，我能把更多時間花在真正的工作上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情報梳理完畢，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前有用的資訊就只有這麼多了。我已將最重要的幾份文檔提高了查閱優先級，你隨時能透過PRTS讀取。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還有沒有新消息？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白面鴞的記錄在這之後就沒更新過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"經過梅爾的調整，九號裝置的資料傳輸趨於穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非白面鴞的身體出現了問題......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我有些擔心白面鴞。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"希望赫默與格雷伊能儘快見到白面鴞。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默會隨時通知我們基地那邊的進展。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭已經收到消息，她一個小時後就會與我們會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，在這段時間內，你還有什麼計畫嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"去繆爾賽思出事的地方看看。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個機械師，不是什麼偵探助手......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但這是目前我們唯一能做的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我也只是個源石研究者。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我只能依靠你了，Mechanist。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，博士，那現在就出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願明天就能回到本艦，見到我親愛的工作臺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:47 P.M. 天氣/陰\n特里蒙城外，359號實驗基地監控站"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"基地裡面的人有沒有發來新的消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，警長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聯繫過你們萊茵的那個什麼斐爾迪南主任了吧？他到底什麼時候能來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南主任正在......開會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開會？你跟我說他還在開會？什麼會議比他手下員工的性命更重要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把望遠鏡給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是不相信那群拓荒者真的會動手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我告訴你，他們會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真被逼急了，他們什麼都做得出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是，我們在基地裡的同事會有生命危險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利維亞·赫默，萊茵生命研究員，也是羅德島製藥的合作醫療幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是我在羅德島的同事，就職於工程部的格雷伊先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您好！我是羅德島的電氣工程師......不過我還在實習期！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島？那又是什麼公司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，也不用跟我解釋。在特里蒙，短短一天就能有幾十家不同名號的新公司冒出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也算是萊茵生命的對吧？你在你們公司能說得上話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得上話？女士，我不是很明白您的意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我知道你不是什麼負責人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一看就是那種......在書堆裡泡著的學者，就和裡面那幾位人質一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們根本不懂怎麼跟那群人打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說他們是在基地工作的拓荒隊成員......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拓荒者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼好聽的名字，只適合放在廣告招牌上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我最清楚他們都是什麼人。罪犯、賭徒、沒錢治病的感染者......走上荒野的時候，他們已經一無所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問......我們可以和他們聊聊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您或許注意到了，我和赫默醫生都是感染者。我們能理解他們的處境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊茵生命，還有那個什麼羅德島都賺了很多錢，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們背後有一家還算有“良心”的企業為你們支付保險帳單——這才是關鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，別說什麼你們能互相理解的傻話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保險帳單？是哪個方面的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是哥倫比亞針對感染者的特殊政策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，請相信我們——羅德島是一家致力於解決感染者問題的醫藥公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解決問題？如果我給你一把弩，你能從這裡幫我把綁匪們擺平嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是一名醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？不，不行的，我想我們還沒到必須戰鬥的那一步......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那看來你們幫不上什麼忙了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......領隊，還是沒人過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們很沉得住氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說會不會......那些大公司根本不在意自己手下人的命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其她們倆還都是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者並沒有低人一等。至少我們自己不該這麼看待彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......拓荒隊招募廣告上也是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們應該慶幸，廣告上也並不全是謊話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你放下那邊的通訊器，烏比卡博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領隊叫你放下！不許動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我放下了。請不要傷害我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領隊，她正在給外面發消息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩姆，把通訊器拿過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，寫了一半，還沒來得及發出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們所在位置的具體座標。你是想讓他們送無人機進來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議你換個思路。編輯一條言辭懇切的求救訊息，發給你的老師，你的主管......隨便誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴他們，我在等。而且，我的耐心有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你究竟想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要的很簡單，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的同伴，我們都只是想活著離開這裡。僅此而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任，您總算回來了！能佔用您一點時間嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......本，結構科的本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您竟然記得我的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我斐爾迪南。在萊茵生命，主任可有九個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南......先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一個會議將在十分鐘之後開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以借你七分鐘時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好的，謝謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您知道總轄現在在哪裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是結構科的設備採購申請表。總轄本來應該在三天前回覆我們......可是她一直沒有消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前結構科已經有多項實驗暫停了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把申請文件給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，去找採購。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您直接簽了字？可是手冊上說，這麼大金額的大型設備購入必須經過總轄......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你加入萊茵生命多久了？才來幾個月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，先生......我一個月前剛來報到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你眼前這片園區了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是很宏偉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五年前，這地方還是一片荒地，連個移動地塊都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候可沒人能在特里蒙的地圖手冊上找到萊茵生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空去找帕爾維斯喝杯茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有很多知識要學習，本。而且它們並不在你的手冊上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵實驗員","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的......我記住了，先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，還剩下四分鐘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你很少在天黑之前聯繫我，斐爾迪南。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......霍爾海雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫你做的事情，你都處理好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯......今天萊茵生命的十科會議上，至少有三個空位吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哦？下一位是哪一科的主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":true,"text":"是你終於厭煩了負責嵌合生命體實驗的老山羊，還是你希望基地裡的那位夢想家也永遠別再回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我聽說羅德島的人去了基地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗就快完成了。在此之前，我不想讓任何人阻撓我們，明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你想讓我去基地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒那個必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":true,"text":"真絕情啊。被綁架的還有你的助手吧？那個叫埃琳娜的小姑娘我見過一次，真是既漂亮又勤奮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我還以為你很喜歡她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為能量科的人，她能搞定拓荒者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你繼續盯著城內的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島不會只派兩名幹員去基地。別忘了，他們和塞雷婭一直有聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哦？又是你們的防衛科主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為塞雷婭，我們的實驗已經耽擱得夠久了......我和上校都快失去耐心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，這一次不要讓他們找到任何東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭收到的最後一條訊息就是從這條巷子裡發出去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看起來很普通。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在特里蒙，類似的巷子有好幾百條。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"距離萊茵生命總部不是很近。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡到萊茵生命總部有至少三十分鐘車程。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"就在商業區旁邊。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時塞雷婭就在商業區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她正在等繆爾賽思，她們約了見面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看來繆爾賽思是被追到這裡的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒有人追趕的話，她一定不會選擇走進這條小巷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論對方是誰，在大街上動手的風險顯然要高得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"赫默提到過繆爾賽思的能力。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"塞雷婭提交過關於繆爾賽思的報告。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......搜索完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“操縱水分子的能力”——能量轉換型還是物質重構型源石技藝？不管是什麼原理，看著都挺強的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“水分身”——肉眼完全無法看出破綻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就更有意思了。從事實驗研究的人，就和我們機械師一樣，觀察能力通常都很敏銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連赫默和梅爾都上當了的話，這可不是一般的法術幻象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"繆爾賽思戰鬥力不弱。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"繆爾賽思自保能力很強。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"繆爾賽思簡直既能打又能跑啊。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地面上留下了一些灼燒的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"範圍不是很廣......動手的人極有可能是利用某種技術設備定向加熱了繆爾賽思周圍的空氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮到她的源石技藝極度依賴水分子，這說明，她的對手很瞭解她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就像我們瞭解她一樣。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對方有可能也是萊茵內部的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"差一點就......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我都要被烤熟了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是能量武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從巷子深處射出來的，敵人距離我們大概只有三十米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還在不斷靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，站到我身後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨身防禦系統已啟動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們是不是被埋伏了？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們能扛得住吧？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，這是我從未見過的新型號動力甲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未經過測試，我無法確定它裝配的武器的破壞能力有多強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，我們必須改變計畫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃生系統已啟動——趴到我背上來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
